{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RogueMaze Ultimate</strong> is a unique maze challenge game that blends <strong>maze exploration</strong> with <strong>Roguelike mechanics</strong>.<br><br>Here, you can\u2019t simply stop whenever you want \u2014 you must keep moving under different rules to reach the exit.<br><br>Each mode completely changes the way you explore, keeping every run fresh and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 10 Modes with Unique Challenges:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: Pure maze exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color</strong>: You can only pass through areas of the same color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause</strong>: Special tiles let you pause \u2014 timing is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trail</strong>: Your path leaves a dangerous trail, no turning back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong>: Gravity alters your movement, making it unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light</strong>: Float like a balloon, slow but risky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.25 Speed</strong>: 25% faster movement \u2014 test your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind</strong>: Limited vision, rely on intuition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buffer</strong>: Input delay requires careful planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse</strong>: Controls are reversed \u2014 adapt or fail.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>: Each run lasts just a few minutes but invites endless retries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse rules, fresh gameplay</strong>: 10 unique modes that change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightweight yet deep</strong>: Simple controls, tough challenges, perfect for both casual and dedicated players.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ultimate Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/5f165b887c5194a86fb32ee626922b7683e24925.jpg"},{"name":"Maze Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/022ffd9b114c1e87743471ccdcc0e8caaa64a647.jpg"},{"name":"Maze Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/443b73a83da23592a09d1407d9c2fa0bed08a6bf.jpg"},{"name":"Maze Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/6a33e99598dc8c474076d035adad2d48819182eb.jpg"},{"name":"Color Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/5ecd0d5f53eafa7b8c68dcc2d53d6f7e8a82e28d.jpg"},{"name":"Color Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/5ba195c6e7ed5b7fc8587b506ff3e2b02a72f27b.jpg"},{"name":"Color Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/57b5122625239443515a5b48f85e7b8e7f5d6f6d.jpg"},{"name":"Pause Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/9a2e2b9dab7d05d9f5985bd3d22266febefaaa08.jpg"},{"name":"Pause Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/cae954cff75a1e25f881b4b85a2ac195c63c6702.jpg"},{"name":"Pause Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067320/39c8ab5dca911e5b7b81832d609ab9c3f86212dd.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067320?t=1774068018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067320/d17e0e13a57d58521defaa0f08747ef9556af72c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=